{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "abb25475897c0c5051e256c35584adac1fce2b531e8c7931a8e7a04774762afc", "ja": "極東", "zh": "远东", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "747bdbb9bebc05b41a48f5fb3aa9864189813aca4848d6943f41f9da3ede83d0", "ja": "極東に潜伏中のエージェントから報せを\r\n受け、百合子達マイティセーラーズが\r\nヒーローズ本部に集合。そこでザ・ネクスト\r\nから『特務機関ネメシス』と『黒髪』の\r\n存在が、ヒーロー達に知らされる。", "zh": "收到潜伏在远东的特务报告后，\n百合子等『Mighty Sailors』成员\n在英雄联盟总部全员集合。\n众英雄在那里经由The Next之口，得知了\n『特务机构Nemesis』与『黑发』的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "7a5d29c895ebd631e66bb0dac63e01d64a1439f03a53028649de89b57c06785c", "ja": "よく来てくれたわね、マイティセーラーズ！\n忙しい時にごめんなさい。", "zh": "『Mighty Sailors』，等你们好久了！\n不好意思，要各位在百忙之中出席。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "2e85b20e6992651acf3141be6dea6b870dbcfcad0970a180364f6713bcbac0c4", "ja": "実は極東に潜伏中のエージェントヒーローから、\n連絡があったの。", "zh": "这次请你们来，是因为潜伏在远东的\n特务英雄捎来了消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "58262a679bce92207b5987ac085908a25fd04ef5383f3114d0fee890026931ce", "ja": "極東っていうと、シャドウレディーと茜ちゃん……\n見習いキャットでしたっけ。何か、あったんですか？", "zh": "远东的话，也就是影子淑女和小茜……\n见习猫咪对吧？发生了什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "6635df66f50881835a594b2d7dc750e0fd56a9f116b2783bd2a4831ef179e177", "ja": "ええ。新たに『特務機関ネメシス』と名乗る、\n強力な組織が確認されたわ。今のところ、正体は不明。", "zh": "嗯，新出现了一个强大的组织，她们自称是\n『特务机构Nemesis』，目前还不清楚她们的底细。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "5ea988737fa4c3cf2a421ed1183ee94e0c5c1eac58ebf010de1f5e4cfd318e4e", "ja": "ただその構成メンバーには、ダークセーラーらしき\n人物と……あの『黒髪』の姿があったと。", "zh": "但看到了疑似『Dark Sailor』的人物……\n以及『黑发』出现在其中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "6e4224d94ff31818f2ca995b274f4968ffdb59e9d627ab6bc3152b5e4067d23b", "ja": "ダークセーラー！？\nそれに『黒髪』って、もしかして、あの……！？", "zh": "『Dark Sailor』！？\n还有你说的『黑发』，难道是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "2ca60ff277eaedeb0aa4ce871708524a4a4c540e92fd780346a616901af285aa", "ja": "昔、ヒーローズの研究所を襲って壊滅させたっていう、\nとんでもないヤツ！だよねっ！？", "zh": "是曾经攻击英雄联盟研究所，\n让整座设施崩坏的可怕家伙！对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7eb2b9d5ff0013245d50bd1bc78156a20aa8bf53f28b22d561274aa979bfe6ea", "ja": "たしか、ジュリアーノのお父さんとお母さんも\nその研究所にいて、亡くなったって……。", "zh": "我记得茱莉亚诺的双亲\n当时也在研究所，并因此不幸身亡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "f2979c00682ebe455ffa0bc75751d459afab64a567e560bd398bd2c0c357995a", "ja": "今は引き続き調査中よ。貴女達マイティセーラーズは、\n敵の正体と目的が掴めるまで待機していてね。", "zh": "目前还在调查，在掌握敌人身分与目的前，\n『Mighty Sailors』的各位成员先待命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c1ff1b52175af4c36367f422babc0118248998757f117645e359457150e2dc9c", "ja": "けど、ふたりだけで大丈夫かな～？\nダークセーラーと、あの『黒髪』が相手なんでしょ？", "zh": "可是，只有她们两个没问题吗～？\n毕竟对手是『Dark Sailor』还有『黑发』耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "cacebb9577b285f37be38976726730907de864f7387b064d756358e9da97cde5", "ja": "シャドウレディーは潜入調査にかけてはベテランだし、\n見習いキャットも素質は十分。信じなさい。", "zh": "影子淑女是潜入调查的老手，\n见习猫咪本身也颇有潜力，相信她们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "d051558add0bf364bb108acac05839c57607876040c5b02454b9b54c8fe42d32", "ja": "ダークセーラー……なら、もしかしてデストル刀を？\nいえ、デストレイピアを手に入れているんでしょうか。", "zh": "如果是『Dark Sailor』……那她们会不会已经\n拿到死欲刀……不，是死欲刺剑了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "2e34915603f843dc8137d7f6bc28d4bd090120a5178a1817722ac59f5b25f911", "ja": "以前、デストルドー日本支部の総帥が使っていた剣ね。\n持ち主によって形を変える……可能性はあるわ。", "zh": "是指死欲日本分部总帅用过的那把剑吧？\n它会随着持有者而变形……你说的不无可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1015_se", "source_sha256": "94a5911f076e7e21e3a3b691b5a97c2d2ead4296a25a27bc5dd145d3e47f298f", "ja": "ズドォーンッ！", "zh": "轰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "283dd07fc7714af38e09abe0b850ffbfdba1b521d541f2d7e808dbd7babe238a", "ja": "ゲホッ、ゲホッ……な、なに？　なんなのアイツ！？\n茜ちゃんの人形攻撃が、全然効かないなんて！", "zh": "咳咳、咳咳……怎、怎么回事？那家伙是怎样！？\n小茜的娃娃攻击居然完全不管用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "0476fb2e585c8b537f2a701d2cb4e32037a5ba662da1ea7e0e0675dca6b3e957", "ja": "あれが『黒髪』です。キャット、先に逃げなさい。\nなんとしても、この情報を本部に……うっ！？", "zh": "她就是『黑发』。猫咪，你先逃，\n无论如何都要把这个情报带回总部……唔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1018_se", "source_sha256": "86cd94d7e440f6fb60bab60b24de6af960522826db5a9de8b5ce98c198c64d0a", "ja": "ドッガァーーーーンッ！", "zh": "轰隆────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "dc75231bea894118a3b21cceb07dd2ea3738a2ecca3024d64e412395eb4f5b3f", "ja": "きゃーっ！？　か、壁を突き破ってキターッ！？\nなんなの、メチャクチャだよ！", "zh": "呀啊──！？竟、竟然打破墙壁杀过来了──！？\n这也太胡来了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "0941b7bff8da365404a6aa952e9a500dc72ac305358fa83385593105043d69bf", "ja": "君達は……ああ、ヒーローズのスパイか。同じ鼠でも\nボクに見つかるなんて、運が悪かったね。さようなら。", "zh": "你们……啊～是英雄联盟的间谍呀。同为鼠辈\n却好死不死被在下发现，真是不走运，永别了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1022_se", "source_sha256": "f094436f3148119fee75c0603f8fd825bc035a3f446a3a652d3655c7ffe26daa", "ja": "ドッゴォーーーーーーン！！！", "zh": "轰隆──────！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "ad283edbb3bb3e4ebd365814c687df56ff1aef2fbd3e22f3bae52e5a3631bf05", "ja": "きゃあーーーーーーっ！？", "zh": "呀啊──────！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "1af7e97494ec854d00b86230407a4bfd953d9ac192d32cd413bd1bb65de8ddc2", "ja": "ギニャーーーーーーッ！？", "zh": "喵啊──────！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_02_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "3f3ebc43882385aa81f551ed9208403bd4ba559d0ccee6ff60866c3f17acd8e8", "ja": "ん？　……これは、身代わりの人形……？\nへぇ。ボクから逃げ切るなんて、やるじゃないか。", "zh": "嗯？……这是替身娃娃……？\n哦，竟然能从在下手中逃掉，挺有一套的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
